    {
      "block_id": "2605.18130_p10_b15",
      "text": "Building upon the CAM-box, we sequentially integrated\nour three fusion mechanisms to address spatial, semantic, and\noptimization robustness. Introducing V1 improves Accuracy\nto 84.75% by mitigating the instability inherent to single-box\nthresholding. Adding V2 explicitly aligns candidate regions\nwith textual descriptors, which strongly biases the model\ntoward recalling malignant features and pushes Sensitivity to\na peak of 92.06%. Conversely, V3 acts as a robust denoising\nmechanism; it favors a more conservative decision boundary\nthat maximizes Specificity (90.91%) and AUC (92.47%) by\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.96,
        630.73,
        300.02,
        748.29
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
